## Ideation Evaluation Criteria

### Market Attractiveness (25%)
- Market size and growth potential
- Customer demand validation
- Competitive landscape favorability
- Regulatory environment stability

### Business Viability (25%)
- Revenue potential and scalability
- Unit economics and profitability
- Capital requirements vs. available funding
- Time to market and breakeven

### Competitive Advantage (20%)
- Sustainable differentiation
- Barriers to entry for competitors
- Intellectual property potential
- Network effects and switching costs

### Execution Feasibility (20%)
- Team capabilities and experience
- Technology development complexity
- Go-to-market execution requirements
- Operational scaling challenges

### Strategic Fit (10%)
- Alignment with company vision
- Synergies with existing capabilities
- Long-term growth potential
- Exit strategy attractiveness

